Package: stardesk
Version: 1.5.4
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: StarDesk Linux Contributors <support@stardesk.com>
Installed-Size: 15200
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), libpipewire-0.3-0 | libpipewire-0.3-0t64, libwayland-client0, xdg-desktop-portal
Recommends: xdg-desktop-portal-gnome | xdg-desktop-portal-kde | xdg-desktop-portal-wlr, libva-utils, nvidia-utils
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://www.stardesk.com
Description: Pure Native Linux implementation of StarDesk Remote Desktop
 StarDesk is an ultra-low-latency remote desktop and game streaming software.
 This package provides the 100% native Linux host daemon and viewer,
 PipeWire desktop capture, /dev/uinput input injection, and hardware acceleration.
 Zero Wine required.
